1
00:00:00,036 --> 00:00:03,536
- Problem?
- No.

2
00:00:04,040 --> 00:00:08,000
l think the Reverend Hofstadter
is making an ironic connection...

3
00:00:08,211 --> 00:00:10,001
(Sheldon:)...between your statement
about love...

4
00:00:10,213 --> 00:00:13,343
(Sheldon:)...and your rejection of his proposal
in the bedroom.

5
00:00:13,550 --> 00:00:14,630
(Penny:)Oh, grow up.

6
00:00:14,843 --> 00:00:16,763
- Hey, I didn't say it.
- That's enough.

7
00:00:16,970 --> 00:00:19,220
- Well, he started it.
- Well, I'm ending it.

8
00:00:22,392 --> 00:00:27,602
"Bernadette, I wanna thank you for
allowing me to be your maid of honor.

9
00:00:28,106 --> 00:00:31,356
l also want you to know
that I will be happy to do it again...

10
00:00:31,568 --> 00:00:34,028
...if this marriage craps out."

11
00:00:39,868 --> 00:00:43,408
(Leonard:)Thank you, Amy. Very touching.

12
00:00:45,081 --> 00:00:46,711
"Howard and Bernadette...

13
00:00:46,916 --> 00:00:49,916
(Leonard:)...you are lucky enough
to be best friends who love each other.

14
00:00:50,128 --> 00:00:53,718
(Leonard:)And that's the strongest kind of love,
because at its core...

15
00:00:53,923 --> 00:00:58,303
(Leonard:)...it has kindness, patience
and respect."

16
00:00:58,511 --> 00:01:07,031
(Leonard:)Qualities that are hard to find
in people these days.

